              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "针对畅销款方向去改款，一定要先抓住畅销款重要特征，一般能达到其中3点以上就能达到基本标准：",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "ftoWFjtYfkCxbtFO",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "1.价格，消费者都喜欢性价比高的东西，每个人都喜欢小便宜，能占大便宜更好。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "mbtXVvijREiwQDno",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "JWYqUQrDhDfWARha",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "2.面料，不是最好的，但一定是实惠的。因为较好的面料成本较高，这样会导致利润空间变小。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "XWxYBnyuSotyMNWr",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "ffvixoLOdEgoIxuC",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "3.色彩，有一定的流行特征，跟着主流走。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "RuWJEauhIiNLfvLl",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "A、过去几季畅销色彩；",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "ntkIVfnufNteVxfl",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "B、参考和竞争品牌或店铺畅销的色彩；",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "RiHWQDSPbUQJWtXP",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "C、结合流行和自己品牌或店铺预计的流行色。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "WLcZbUEUNDFaJmNH",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "MZNiFctwvVLHgWYW",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "4.创新与非创新保持平衡。没有创新的设计元素款式容易沦为平销款甚至滞销款，但创新设计元素过火或过多，那受众面就会变窄。所以一定要把握平衡！",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "cLZwVOqMYuncNVIG",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "rnKgljpFDmIMGeHL",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "5. 跨季节性强、销售周期长。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "ZktCmkXDdCxaAncs",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "uxYxZEIIxZFbQjDV",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "6. 相对独立，不容易撞款，非市场大众款。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "qkqZnaoELOJKHjBu",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "id": "TSjbUfoloPkhmKUT",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "7.处于市场上升期，处于增量市场（比如品类）。",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ],
              "id": "AdkePhyUQPgobbLw",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "align": 1
